{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["幂级数", "收敛域"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$[0,6)$", "explanation": "记\n\n$$\nu_n=\\frac{(x-3)^n}{n3^n}.\n$$\n\n由比值判别法，\n\n$$\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n}\\right|\n=\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\n\\left|\n\\frac{(x-3)^{n+1}}{(n+1)3^{n+1}}\n\\cdot\n\\frac{n3^n}{(x-3)^n}\n\\right|\n=\\frac{|x-3|}{3}.\n$$\n\n当 $\\frac{|x-3|}{3}<1$，即 $0<x<6$ 时，幂级数收敛。\n\n当 $x=0$ 时，原级数为\n\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^n}{n},\n$$\n\n收敛。\n\n当 $x=6$ 时，原级数为\n\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n},\n$$\n\n发散。\n\n所以收敛域为 $[0,6)$。", "methods": ["比值判别法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["反函数", "函数定义域"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\varphi(x)=\\sqrt{\\ln(1-x)}$，定义域为 $(-\\infty,0]$", "explanation": "由\n\n$$\nf(x)=e^{x^2},\\quad f[\\varphi(x)]=1-x\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\ne^{[\\varphi(x)]^2}=1-x.\n$$\n\n两边取自然对数：\n\n$$\n[\\varphi(x)]^2=\\ln(1-x).\n$$\n\n又 $\\varphi(x)\\ge 0$，所以\n\n$$\n\\varphi(x)=\\sqrt{\\ln(1-x)}.\n$$\n\n为使根号内有意义，需\n\n$$\n\\ln(1-x)\\ge 0 \\iff 1-x\\ge 1 \\iff x\\le 0.\n$$\n\n故定义域为 $(-\\infty,0]$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["第二型曲面积分", "高斯公式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{12\\pi}{5}$", "explanation": "令 $\\Omega$ 为单位球 $x^2+y^2+z^2\\le 1$。由高斯公式，\n\n$$\nI=\\iiint_{\\Omega}\n\\left(\n\\frac{\\partial x^3}{\\partial x}\n+\\frac{\\partial y^3}{\\partial y}\n+\\frac{\\partial z^3}{\\partial z}\n\\right)\\,dv\n=3\\iiint_{\\Omega}(x^2+y^2+z^2)\\,dv.\n$$\n\n用球坐标计算：\n\n$$\nI\n=3\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_0^\\pi d\\varphi\\int_0^1\nr^2\\cdot r^2\\sin\\varphi\\,dr\n=3\\cdot 2\\pi\\cdot 2\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\n=\\frac{12\\pi}{5}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$(2t+1)e^{2t}$", "explanation": "由\n\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^{2tx}=e^{2t},\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\nf(t)=t e^{2t}.\n$$\n\n因此\n\n$$\nf'(t)=e^{2t}+2t e^{2t}=(2t+1)e^{2t}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["傅里叶级数", "收敛定理"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{3}{2}$", "explanation": "答案页写作 $\\dfrac{2}{3}$，但这与题干和傅里叶级数收敛定理不一致。按题干推导如下。\n\n该函数以 $2$ 为周期。傅里叶级数在跳跃间断点处收敛于左右极限的平均值。\n\n在 $x=1$ 处，\n\n$$\nf(1-0)=1^3=1.\n$$\n\n由周期性，\n\n$$\nf(1+0)=f(-1+0)=2.\n$$\n\n所以傅里叶级数在 $x=1$ 处收敛于\n\n$$\n\\frac{f(1-0)+f(1+0)}{2}\n=\\frac{1+2}{2}\n=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n\n因此，按当前题干，傅里叶级数在 $x=1$ 处的收敛值应为 $\\dfrac{3}{2}$。源答案页的 $\\dfrac{2}{3}$ 与上述步骤不符，按排印或答案页录入错误处理。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["变上限积分", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{12}$", "explanation": "对等式\n\n$$\n\\int_0^{x^3-1}f(t)\\,dt=x\n$$\n\n两边关于 $x$ 求导，得\n\n$$\nf(x^3-1)\\cdot 3x^2=1.\n$$\n\n要求 $f(7)$，令 $x^3-1=7$，得 $x=2$。于是\n\n$$\nf(7)=\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 2^2}=\\frac{1}{12}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["行列式", "多重线性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$40$", "explanation": "因为\n\n$$\nA+B=(\\alpha+\\beta,\\ 2\\gamma_2,\\ 2\\gamma_3,\\ 2\\gamma_4),\n$$\n\n由行列式关于列的线性性，\n\n$$\n|A+B|\n=8|\\alpha+\\beta,\\gamma_2,\\gamma_3,\\gamma_4|\n=8\\left(|A|+|B|\\right)\n=8(4+1)=40.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": [], "answer": "B", "explanation": "函数在 $x=x_0$ 处的微分为\n\n$$\ndy=f'(x_0)\\Delta x=\\frac{1}{2}\\Delta x.\n$$\n\n当 $\\Delta x\\to 0$ 时，$dy$ 与 $\\Delta x$ 同阶；但二者之比趋于 $\\frac{1}{2}$，不是 $1$，所以不是等价无穷小。\n\n故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数微分方程", "极值判定"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": [], "answer": "A", "explanation": "由微分方程\n\n$$\ny''-2y'+4y=0\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\nf''(x_0)=2f'(x_0)-4f(x_0).\n$$\n\n已知 $f'(x_0)=0,\\ f(x_0)>0$，所以\n\n$$\nf''(x_0)=-4f(x_0)<0.\n$$\n\n因此 $f(x)$ 在 $x_0$ 处取得极大值。\n\n故选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["三重积分", "对称性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "$\\Omega_1$ 是上半球，$\\Omega_2$ 是第一卦限内的八分之一球。\n\n对被积函数 $z$，在上半球内关于 $x,y$ 对称，且 $\\Omega_1$ 可以按 $x,y$ 的符号分成 $4$ 个与 $\\Omega_2$ 对称的部分，所以\n\n$$\n\\iiint_{\\Omega_1}z\\,dv\n=4\\iiint_{\\Omega_2}z\\,dv.\n$$\n\n而 $x,y,xyz$ 在相关对称区域中会出现正负抵消或符号不一致，不能得到对应选项的等式。\n\n故选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["幂级数", "收敛半径"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": [], "answer": "B", "explanation": "设\n\n$$\nb_n=a_n(-2)^n.\n$$\n\n已知级数在 $x=-1$ 处收敛，即 $\\sum b_n$ 收敛，因此 $b_n\\to 0$，从而 $\\{b_n\\}$ 有界。设 $|b_n|\\le M$。\n\n当 $x=2$ 时，原级数为\n\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n.\n$$\n\n又\n\n$$\n|a_n|=\\frac{|b_n|}{2^n}\\le \\frac{M}{2^n},\n$$\n\n故 $\\sum |a_n|$ 收敛，所以在 $x=2$ 处绝对收敛。\n\n故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性无关"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": [], "answer": "D", "explanation": "向量组线性无关的等价刻画是：其中任意一个向量都不能由其余向量线性表示。\n\n选项 A 只说明存在某个非零线性组合不为零，这对线性相关向量组也可能成立，不充分。\n\n选项 B 只要求任意两个向量线性无关，不能排除三个或更多向量之间的线性相关。\n\n选项 C 只要求存在一个向量不能由其余向量表示，也不足以推出整个向量组线性无关。\n\n故选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二元函数偏导数", "齐次函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$0$", "explanation": "由\n\n$$\nu=yf\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)+xg\\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right)\n$$\n\n可得\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}\n=f'\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)\n+g\\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right)\n-\\frac{y}{x}g'\\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right).\n$$\n\n继续求导：\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x^2}\n=\\frac{1}{y} f''\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)\n+\\frac{y^2}{x^3}g''\\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right),\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x\\partial y}\n=-\\frac{x}{y^2}f''\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)\n-\\frac{y}{x^2}g''\\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right).\n$$\n\n因此\n\n$$\nx\\frac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x^2}\n+y\\frac{\\partial^2u}{\\partial x\\partial y}\n=0.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程", "初值问题"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$y=(1-2x)e^x$", "explanation": "对应齐次方程\n\n$$\ny''-3y'+2y=0\n$$\n\n的特征根为 $1,2$，故齐次通解为\n\n$$\nY=C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}.\n$$\n\n由于右端为 $2e^x$，取特解\n\n$$\ny^*=Axe^x.\n$$\n\n代入原方程得 $A=-2$，所以\n\n$$\ny=C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}-2xe^x.\n$$\n\n曲线 $y=x^2-x+1$ 在 $(0,1)$ 处的切线斜率为 $-1$，因此\n\n$$\ny(0)=1,\\quad y'(0)=-1.\n$$\n\n代入通解：\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}\nC_1+C_2=1,\\\\\nC_1+2C_2=1,\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n\n解得 $C_1=1,\\ C_2=0$。\n\n故\n\n$$\ny=(1-2x)e^x.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲线积分", "变力做功"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$k\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt5}\\right)$", "explanation": "设质点 $M$ 的坐标为 $(x,y)$。由 $A(0,1)$ 指向 $M(x,y)$ 的距离为\n\n$$\nr=\\sqrt{x^2+(1-y)^2}.\n$$\n\n引力方向与 $\\overrightarrow{MA}=\\{-x,1-y\\}$ 一致，故力为\n\n$$\n\\vec F=\\frac{k}{r^3}\\{-x,1-y\\}.\n$$\n\n所作功为\n\n$$\nW=\\int_{\\widehat{BO}}\\frac{k}{r^3}\\left[-x\\,dx+(1-y)\\,dy\\right].\n$$\n\n由于\n\n$$\nd\\left(\\frac{1}{r}\\right)\n=\\frac{-x\\,dx+(1-y)\\,dy}{r^3},\n$$\n\n所以\n\n$$\nW=k\\left[\\frac{1}{r}\\right]_B^O.\n$$\n\n在 $O(0,0)$ 处 $r=1$，在 $B(2,0)$ 处 $r=\\sqrt5$，故\n\n$$\nW=k\\left(1-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt5}\\right).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵方程", "矩阵幂"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\2&0&0\\\\6&-1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$，且 $A^5=A$", "explanation": "由\n\n$$\nP=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n2&-1&0\\\\\n2&1&1\n\\end{pmatrix}\n$$\n\n可求得\n\n$$\nP^{-1}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n2&-1&0\\\\\n-4&1&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n由 $AP=PB$，得\n\n$$\nA=PBP^{-1}.\n$$\n\n因此\n\n$$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n2&0&0\\\\\n6&-1&-1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n又因\n\n$$\nB^5=B,\n$$\n\n所以\n\n$$\nA^5=(PBP^{-1})^5=PB^5P^{-1}=PBP^{-1}=A.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["相似矩阵", "可逆矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$x=0,\\ y=1$；可取 $P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "因为 $A$ 与 $B$ 相似，所以二者特征多项式相同：\n\n$$\n|\\lambda E-A|=|\\lambda E-B|.\n$$\n\n即\n\n$$\n(\\lambda-2)(\\lambda^2-x\\lambda-1)\n=\n(\\lambda-2)(\\lambda^2+(1-y)\\lambda-y).\n$$\n\n比较系数得\n\n$$\nx=0,\\quad y=1.\n$$\n\n此时\n\n$$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2&0&0\\\\\n0&0&1\\\\\n0&1&0\n\\end{pmatrix},\n\\quad\nB=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2&0&0\\\\\n0&1&0\\\\\n0&0&-1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n$A$ 的三个特征值为 $2,1,-1$。可分别取特征向量\n\n$$\np_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\np_2=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\np_3=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n令\n\n$$\nP=(p_1,p_2,p_3)\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n0&1&1\\\\\n0&1&-1\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n\n则 $P$ 可逆，且\n\n$$\nP^{-1}AP=B.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分应用", "面积", "存在唯一性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": [], "answer": "见解析", "explanation": "对 $t\\in[a,b]$，令\n\n$$\nF(t)=\n\\int_a^t [f(t)-f(x)]\\,dx\n-3\\int_t^b [f(x)-f(t)]\\,dx.\n$$\n\n则 $F(t)$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上连续。\n\n因为 $f'(x)>0$，所以 $f(x)$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上单调增加。取 $c\\in(a,b)$，则\n\n$$\nF(a)\n=-3\\int_a^b[f(x)-f(a)]\\,dx\n<0,\n$$\n\n且\n\n$$\nF(b)\n=\\int_a^b[f(b)-f(x)]\\,dx\n>0.\n$$\n\n由介值定理，存在 $\\xi\\in(a,b)$，使 $F(\\xi)=0$。这正表示\n\n$$\nS_1=3S_2.\n$$\n\n下面证唯一性。对 $F(t)$ 求导：\n\n$$\nF'(t)=f'(t)\\big[(t-a)+3(b-t)\\big].\n$$\n\n由于 $f'(t)>0$，且\n\n$$\n(t-a)+3(b-t)>0,\n$$\n\n故 $F'(t)>0$。因此 $F(t)$ 在 $(a,b)$ 内严格单调增加，零点唯一。\n\n所以在 $(a,b)$ 内存在唯一的 $\\xi$，使 $S_1=3S_2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 2, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["独立重复试验"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{3}$", "explanation": "设事件 $A$ 在一次试验中出现的概率为 $p$。由题意，\n\n$$\n1-(1-p)^3=\\frac{19}{27}.\n$$\n\n因此\n\n$$\n(1-p)^3=\\frac{8}{27},\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\n1-p=\\frac{2}{3},\\quad p=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 2, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["几何概型"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{17}{25}$", "explanation": "设随机取到的两个数为 $X,Y$，则样本空间为单位正方形\n\n$$\n0<X<1,\\quad 0<Y<1.\n$$\n\n要求事件\n\n$$\nX+Y<\\frac{6}{5}.\n$$\n\n其补事件为 $X+Y\\ge \\frac{6}{5}$。在单位正方形中，补事件对应右上角直角三角形，两条直角边长度均为\n\n$$\n1-\\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{4}{5}.\n$$\n\n故补事件面积为\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{4}{5}\\cdot \\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{8}{25}.\n$$\n\n所求概率为\n\n$$\n1-\\frac{8}{25}=\\frac{17}{25}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 2, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["正态分布"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$0.9876$", "explanation": "由题意，$X$ 服从均值 $10$、标准差 $0.02$ 的正态分布。于是\n\n$$\nP(9.95<X<10.05)\n=P\\left(\\frac{9.95-10}{0.02}<Z<\\frac{10.05-10}{0.02}\\right),\n$$\n\n即\n\n$$\nP(-2.5<Z<2.5)=2\\Phi(2.5)-1.\n$$\n\n代入 $\\Phi(2.5)=0.9938$，得\n\n$$\n2\\times 0.9938-1=0.9876.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1988", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1988, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["随机变量函数分布", "概率密度"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$f_Y(y)=\\dfrac{3(1-y)^2}{\\pi\\left[1+(1-y)^6\\right]}$", "explanation": "这里的关键是变量变换时要乘上反函数导数的绝对值。\n\n由\n\n$$\nY=1-\\sqrt[3]{X}\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\nX=(1-Y)^3.\n$$\n\n先求分布函数：\n\n$$\nF_Y(y)=P(Y<y)\n=P\\left(1-\\sqrt[3]{X}<y\\right)\n=P\\left(X>(1-y)^3\\right).\n$$\n\n因此\n\n$$\nF_Y(y)\n=\\int_{(1-y)^3}^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{\\pi(1+x^2)}\n=\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\arctan(1-y)^3\\right].\n$$\n\n对 $y$ 求导，得\n\n$$\nf_Y(y)\n=\\frac{d}{dy}F_Y(y)\n=\\frac{3(1-y)^2}{\\pi\\left[1+(1-y)^6\\right]}.\n$$\n\n其中\n\n$$\n\\left|\\frac{d}{dy}(1-y)^3\\right|=3(1-y)^2,\n$$\n\n这正是变量变换时需要乘上的反函数导数绝对值。", "methods": []}
